<title>ESTONIA: KAUBAMAJA TO BE TRADED ON THE MAIN LIST.</title>
<headline>KAUBAMAJA TO BE TRADED ON THE MAIN LIST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the Tallinna Kaubamaja department store will be traded on the main list of the Tallinn stock exchange from August 19, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bourse said that the listing commission decided on Tuesday to approve the application of Kaubmaja to trade its 6.8 million shares on the main list of the Tallinn stock exchange.</p>
<p>Kaubamaja is currently traded on the free market of the exchange.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
